OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fdry for most, a few breaks in the
OL,7,Fcloud develop across Kent, while rain
OL,8,Faffects western counties later in the
OL,9,Fnight. Becoming windy along the coast
OL,10,Fby morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FWestern counties bearing the
OL,13,Fbrunt of the rain, with some heavy and
OL,14,Fprolonged periods. While eastern
OL,15,Fcounties remain largely dry until
OL,16,Flater in the afternoon. Windy,
OL,17,Fespecially along coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
