OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunny
OL,6,Ffor most of Sunday once rain clears
OL,7,Fthe far east. Cloudy periods but dry
OL,8,Fon Monday. Rain moves in from the
OL,9,Fnorthwest Tuesday afternoon. Above
OL,10,Faverage temperatures.
